    "Actual PostgreSQL 17 dump/restore exposed missing database-level ACLs in a no-create archive. Only the NEW target receives the exact existing M008 CREATE/TEMP/CONNECT boundary.",
    "PostgreSQL dump/reparse changes a VARCHAR IN array cast spelling. The restore-only path permits exactly this observed rendering, reinstalls the original CHECK with validation, and passes the unchanged byte-exact schema validator. Other catalog/privilege differences are rejected.",
    "Full regression exposed a preexisting C13 NOWAIT test race with short heartbeat updates. The assertion now waits at most 500ms while inference remains gated for four seconds; production worker behavior is unchanged.",
    "Full regression exposed ambiguous ordering of equal trigger names across tables in the historical migration test snapshot. The snapshot now includes the table name and orders by table and trigger; no migration or constraint was changed.",
    "Earlier failed regression runs are not included in passed counts. The final complete core and direct/Vite browser reruns passed with the daily database guard unchanged."
  ],
